<div style="font-family: -apple-system, Segoe UI, sans-serif; color: #485064; line-height: 1.6;">
  <p style="font-size: 20px; color: #22113A; margin: 0 0 16px;">Someone asked to change your address</p>

  <p>
    A request was made to move this Prachar account to <strong><%= @new_email %></strong>.
    Nothing has changed yet &mdash; it only happens once that address is confirmed.
  </p>

  <%# Sent to the address they can still read, while it can still be stopped. %>
  <p style="background:#F8E7E9; border:1px solid #E7B9BF; border-radius:8px; padding:14px 16px;">
    <strong style="color:#22113A;">If this was not you</strong>, change your password now
    using "Forgotten your password" on the sign-in page. That signs out every device and
    stops the change.
  </p>
</div>
